  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLARE - Met Office Collaboration Placements Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide weather and climate services to inform investments and actions by FCDO, UK Government and humanitarian partners, in collaboration mainly with the UK Met Office, supporting development and humanitarian teams with timely information on long-term climate risks as well as immediate threats that enable prompt an effective response to crises as well as long-term resource planning.</narrative>
  </description>
